                style="animation-delay: 150ms"
        >
            A minimal portfolio showcasing selected works and upcoming performances by
            electronic music artist Ian Kita.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div
            class="animate-load flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm font-heading font-medium text-swiss-white uppercase tracking-widest"
            style="animation-delay: 300ms"
    >
    <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-swiss-red"></span>
      Available for booking
    </span>
        <span class="text-swiss-white">Techno</span>
        <span class="text-swiss-white">Tech House</span>
